  "notes": "{惜|お}しむ expresses reluctance to part with something valued.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{別|わか}れ→別れ：03788_wakare⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惜|お}しむ: to regret parting\n- 〜⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{惜|お}しまない: to not spare ~, to give generously\n- ⟦{惜|お}しみなく→惜しみない：22599_oshiminai⟧: unstintingly, generously\n- 〜⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{惜|お}しい→惜しい：10243_oshii⟧: it's a waste of ~\n\nVERB TYPE: Godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}), transitive\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{惜|お}しい→惜しい：10243_oshii⟧ (adjective): regrettable, precious\n- {惜|お}しげ⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦なく→ない：01118_nai⟧: without hesitation, freely",
